  },
  "ingredients": [
    "16 ounce green cabbage",
    "4 tablespoon butter (divided)",
    "16 ounce ground beef",
    "1 tablespoon red wine vinegar",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "1 teaspoon onion powder",
    "1/4 teaspoon black pepper",
    "2 tablespoon tomato paste",
    "2 teaspoon fresh garlic (finely chopped)",
    "3 ounce green onion (thinly sliced)",
    "2 1/2 ounce fresh basil (chopped)",
    "1/2 cup sour cream (for serving)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all the ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-italian-cabbage-stir-fry/#wprm-recipe-53917-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Keto-Italian-Cabbage-Stir-Fry-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using a knife or a mandolin, shred the cabbage finely.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-italian-cabbage-stir-fry/#wprm-recipe-53917-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Keto-Italian-Cabbage-Stir-Fry-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Over low to medium heat, heat the cabbage with half of the butter. Let this cook for about 10 minutes or until the cabbage turns soft.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-italian-cabbage-stir-fry/#wprm-recipe-53917-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Keto-Italian-Cabbage-Stir-Fry-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the red wine vinegar, salt, onion powder, and pepper. Stir together well and let everything combine. Take the cabbage out of the pot and set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-italian-cabbage-stir-fry/#wprm-recipe-53917-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Keto-Italian-Cabbage-Stir-Fry-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the same pan, add the rest of the butter, fresh garlic, and green onions. Stir to combine well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-italian-cabbage-stir-fry/#wprm-recipe-53917-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Keto-Italian-Cabbage-Stir-Fry-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the ground beef to the pan and cook until the beef browns.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-italian-cabbage-stir-fry/#wprm-recipe-53917-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Keto-Italian-Cabbage-Stir-Fry-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add tomato paste and stir well. Add the cooked cabbage back to the pan along with basil.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-italian-cabbage-stir-fry/#wprm-recipe-53917-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Keto-Italian-Cabbage-Stir-Fry-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve with sour cream. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-italian-cabbage-stir-fry/#wprm-recipe-53917-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
